  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe way `Grabbable` is implemented right now is not really that nice. A lot of people prefer the way you could move the mirror before. The current implementation will force the mirror to always look at you when you are holding it and there is no way to move / tilt it away from you.\n# Suggestion:\nChange the `Grabbable` button to a `Pickup Mode` button. Basically when Pickup Mode is enabled, it behaves like the mirror does in 1218, so just like a normal pickup. Maybe still allow to move it closer or further away with the thumbstick though.\nThis is how I and other would want to move the mirror, it allows for a more free placement of it.",
